        "text_copy_copy488896": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-b3eaac8b1c@example.invalid",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Target<sup>®</sup> 360 Detachable Coil<br>\n </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Smooth and stable from frame to finish.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>Target 360 Detachable Coils are the gold standard in complex coil shape technology, the 360 shape provides uniform distribution, concentric filling and neck coverage.<br>\n</p>\n",
