      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-73104d59b2@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 14 2024 14:00:31 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Open center<br>\n </span></span>The 360 shape is designed to seek the outer wall and leave an open center, allowing for concentric filling.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">2D distal loop<br>\n </span></span>The first 1.5 loops are 25% smaller than the stated secondary coil diameter, designed to reduce coil herniation.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Open loop configuration<br>\n </span></span>Open loops conform to multiple aneurysm shapes while minimizing compartmentalization.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 14 2024 14:04:53 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "cq:responsive": {
